OL,3,GNEWSAMurderer arrested carrying knife
OL,4,Adays after killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stabbed his housemate to
OL,7,Fdeath at a property in Birmingham has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for life.
OL,10,FAbdou Sillah, 24, lived at a shared
OL,11,Fproperty in Swanage Road, Small Heath,
OL,12,Falongside 29-year-old Kiirpal Nhian.
OL,13,FPolice received an emergency call on 20
OL,14,FDecember last year after Nhian was
OL,15,Ffound collapsed in the garden.
OL,17,FHe was not breathing and had suffered a
OL,18,Fstab wound to his chest. He was
OL,19,Fpronounced dead a short time later.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
