OL,3,GNEWSAMurderer arrested carrying knife
OL,4,Adays after killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FSillah appeared at Birmingham Crown
OL,7,FCourt on 29 September and was sentenced
OL,8,Fto life in prison, with a minimum term
OL,9,Fof 22 years.
